    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="47.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 47.1</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="47.1" corresp="#wit-g-a">And gif man ætsace, ladige mid þryfealdre lade.</ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="47.1" corresp="#wit-a">And gif man ætsace, ladige mid þryfealdre lade.</ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="47.1" corresp="#wit-q">Si negetur, triplici lada fiat.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#robertson" n="47.1" corresp="#wit-b">And gyf man ætsace, ladige hine mid ðryfealdre lade.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#rabin-doml" corresp="#wit-g-a">And gif man ætsace, ladige mid þryfealdre lade.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#robertson" corresp="#wit-b">And if anyone denies [the charge], he shall clear himself by the triple process of exculpation.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#rabin-doml" corresp="#wit-g-a">And if anyone denies the accusation, he must exonerate himself with the threefold oath.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#whitelock">And if anyone denies it, he is to clear himself with the three-fold process of exculpation.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann">Und wenn man sich [gegen solche Anklage] vertheidigen will, reinige man sich durch dreifachen Beweis.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">And if one denies [such a charge], let one clear oneself by the threefold clearing.</ab>
        <note type="textual" source="#rabin-doml">ladige mid: ladige hine mid B</note>
      </div>
    </body>
